      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential Estate Agents are delighted to present 26 The Crescent, Silverbanks to the Stamullen property market.\r\n\r\nExceptional A-Rated Family Home | TURNKEY | Prime Location\r\n\r\nPresented in turnkey condition, 26 The Crescent is a contemporary 3-bedroom, 3-bathroom home located in the highly sought-after Silverbanks development. Built in 2022, this home combines modern architectural design with an impressive A2 energy rating, ensuring maximum comfort and low running costs for the modern family. \r\n\r\nIdeally situated in the heart of Stamullen village, the property offers a perfect balance of peaceful living and superb connectivity. Commuters will appreciate being just a 5-minute drive from Gormanston Train Station and the M1 motorway, providing a direct route to Dublin City Centre in approximately 35 minutes and Dublin Airport in 20 minutes. Within walking distance, residents have access to local primary and secondary schools, playgrounds, and essential village amenities. This is a rare opportunity to acquire a high-specification, future-proofed home in one of Meath’s most popular residential communities.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: All details are provided to the best of our knowledge. While we strive for accuracy, some information may have been provided by the vendor. We are not liable for any mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising, and we advise all interested parties to seek professional advice regarding any concerns."
